# Who ilo trusts. pr-vouch.yml labels each pull request with its author's standing here, read
# from main through mitchellh/vouch (https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch). Collaborators with
# write access count as vouched without a line. CONTRIBUTING.md says how to get vouched.
# Adapted from T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code, MIT) at commit
# 570d4b03eef879bd60be3d74444046858c94dacd.
#
# Syntax:
#   github:username
#   -github:username reason for denouncement
#
# Keep entries sorted alphabetically.
github:MartinPTielemans
